 executing our work to drive greater efficiency, improved service and higher customer satisfaction.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/26/spire-inc-sr-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"SR 2020 Q3","e":"sr","d":"2020-08-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Steven P. Rasche","x":"These cost savings stem from the realization of operational efficiencies, timing, and prior year costs that did not recur this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/05/spire-inc-sr-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"SR 2020 Q3","e":"sr","d":"2020-08-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Harry","x":"And then on the storage front, with regards to the year was down, impacting your debt to cap, do you guys anticipate any incremental equity needs to kind of rightsize the balance sheet?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/05/spire-inc-sr-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"SR 2020 Q4","e":"sr","d":"2020-11-18","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Steve Lindsey","x":"Lastly, we want to combine Missouri East and Missouri West under a single tariff to reflect the integrated utility that we operate today to serve our 1.2 million customers in the state.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/18/spire-inc-sr-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SR 2020 Q4","e":"sr","d":"2020-11-18","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Steve Lindsey","x":"But ultimately, they should translate to O&M cost savings as well.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/18/spire-inc-sr-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SR 2020 Q4","e":"sr","d":"2020-11-18","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Selman Akyol","x":"And then a number of times you talked about cost savings, and I'm just wondering, is there more of that to come as we go forward?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/18/spire-inc-sr-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SR 2021 Q1","e":"sr","d":"2021-02-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Steve Lindsey","x":"The one piece that I would add that's a little different about this one than maybe some of our prior cases is, there's one of the things we're looking to do is to combine the two utilities; Missouri East and Missouri West under one tariff.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/04/spire-inc-sr-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SR 2021 Q1","e":"sr","d":"2021-02-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Steve Lindsey","x":"We're the same owner per se, but we're having to operate a little bit differently right now just because of tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/04/spire-inc-sr-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SR 2021 Q2","e":"sr","d":"2021-05-07","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Steven Lindsey","x":"We are pursuing these marketers for tariff-based gas costs and penalties not yet recovered.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/07/spire-inc-sr-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SR 2021 Q2","e":"sr","d":"2021-05-07","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Steven P. Rasche","x":"We felt compelled to make that move legally because the counterparties hadn't paid anything, the cost of gas, much less the penalties that are defined and prescribed in the tariffs, which we have no control over.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/07/spire-inc-sr-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SR 2021 Q3","e":"sr","d":"2021-08-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Adam Woodard","x":"Notably, agreement was reached on recovery of COVID-19 costs deferred under our Accounting Authorization Order or AAO, the creation of a combined cap for our infrastructure system replacement surcharge rider, and we have made strides toward unifying the tariffs and purchase gas recovery mechanisms.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/06/spire-inc-sr-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SR 2021 Q4","e":"sr","d":"2021-11-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Scott Carter","x":"And so, our anticipation is to the extent the commission finds that some of those costs should not be capitalized going forward that we'll be able to recover those in future rates through an O&M cost out and just like the other O&M elements.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/22/spire-inc-sr-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SR 2025 Q4","e":"sr","d":"2025-11-14","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Scott Edward Doyle","x":"So to the point when we think about earned returns within the utility coming out of the Missouri rate case, there's a step up associated with that as we've brought capital into base rates from an extended period over the last several years, capital that had not passed through our ISRS mechanism.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/14/spire-sr-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[35,1,9867,0,0,0,8609,937],[37,1,5338,0,0,0,4685,346],[38,1,6837,0,0,0,5994,513],[39,1,8928,0,0,0,7928,664],[40,1,7977,0,0,0,6727,868],[41,1,8696,0,0,0,7571,796],[42,1,7975,0,0,0,7041,616],[43,1,10121,0,0,0,8159,1493],[44,1,8386,0,0,0,7245,806],[45,1,9423,0,0,0,7921,1124],[46,1,6512,0,0,0,5108,1104],[47,1,7240,0,0,0,6227,674],[63,1,4789,0,0,0,3865,669],[64,1,3902,0,0,0,2881,768],[65,1,4117,0,0,0,1544,1962],[66,1,4137,0,0,0,1440,2461]],"cinema":[[35,1,9867,0,0,0,8609,937],[37,1,5338,0,0,0,4685,346],[38,1,6837,0,0,0,5994,513],[39,1,8928,0,0,0,7928,664],[40,1,7977,0,0,0,6727,868],[41,1,8696,0,0,0,7571,796],[42,1,7975,0,0,0,7041,616],[43,1,10121,0,0,0,8159,1493],[44,1,8386,0,0,0,7245,806],[45,1,9423,0,0,0,7921,1124],[46,1,6512,0,0,0,5108,1104],[47,1,7240,0,0,0,6227,674],[63,1,4789,0,0,0,3865,669],[64,1,3902,0,0,0,2881,768],[65,1,4117,0,0,0,1544,1962],[66,1,4137,0,0,0,1440,2461]],"imax":[[35,1,9867,0,0,0,8609,937],[37,1,5338,0,0,0,4685,346],[38,1,68